WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.867
Identify landmarks and draw a simple route

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.637
Sketch map: a simple drawing showing where places are located. Key: a guide

00:00:08.637 --> 00:00:11.368
explaining the signs or symbols on a map.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.341
Compass direction: north, south, east or west used to show location. Landmark: a

00:00:17.341 --> 00:00:22.877
visible feature used to identify a place. Route: a path used to travel between

00:00:22.877 --> 00:00:23.272
places.

00:00:24.117 --> 00:00:27.957
Draw a map from the classroom to the school gate with a key and two landmarks.
